-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- workspace.follows: what a person follows (spec 33.7; decision 2026-11-17): a Cron, or a
-- saved view of an object set, that someone else owns and they could see when they chose to
-- follow it. What a person owns they follow without a row. Home briefs on runs of followed
-- Crons and on findings on followed object sets; a follow grants nothing, so access is
-- resolved again whenever the briefing is read, and one the person can no longer see is
-- simply not shown.
